{"title":"Small Coral Snake","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 6 Snake that attacks with corrode (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">slash</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">corrode</span><span class=\"tag-chip resist\">crush</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      \n      <p class=\"s\">Special: venomChance: .6 | venomDamage: 8 | venomDurationMs: 8e3</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 9 looted corpses recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"snake-fang\" title=\"Snake Fang - in 5 of 9 looted corpses, 5 recorded drops, 5 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/f1a8cba3a8479382b961.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Snake Fang</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1.8<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"snake-meat\" title=\"Snake Meat - in 5 of 9 looted corpses, 5 recorded drops, 5 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/d15830124444cf29d721.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Snake Meat</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1.8<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"venom-gland\" title=\"Venom Gland - in 4 of 9 looted corpses, 4 recorded drops, 4 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/de59cbec471a8d0c3fd8.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Venom Gland</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/2<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"deerhide-arms\" title=\"Deerhide Arm